<h1 class="email-heading">New sign-in to your account</h1>
<p class="email-text">
  Your JobJournal account was just signed into from <strong><%= @device.browser %> on <%= @device.label.join(" · ") %></strong>
  at <%= @session.created_at.to_fs(:long) %> UTC (IP address <%= @session.ip_address %>).
</p>
<a href="<%= security_url %>" class="email-button">Review Active Sessions</a>
<p class="email-note">
  If this was you, there’s nothing to do. If it wasn’t, sign that session out from the link above and change your password.
</p>
